msgid "Options"
msgstr "Options"

msgid ""
"**File > Options...** opens the settings. The pages are listed on the "
"left; this chapter says what each one holds and where the manual explains"
" it."
msgstr ""
"**File > Options...** abre los ajustes. Las páginas aparecen a la "
"izquierda; este capítulo dice qué contiene cada una y dónde lo explica el"
" manual."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`ok-apply` **OK** applies the changes and closes the window, "
"**Apply** applies them and keeps it open, {icon}`cancel` **Cancel** "
"discards them. Hold the mouse over a setting to see what it does."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`ok-apply` **OK** aplica los cambios y cierra la ventana, **Apply**"
" los aplica y la deja abierta, {icon}`cancel` **Cancel** los descarta. "
"Deja el ratón sobre un ajuste para ver qué hace."

msgid "Machine"
msgstr "Machine"

msgid "![The Machine page](images/options-machine.png)"
msgstr "![La página Machine](images/options-machine.png)"

msgid "The Machine page"
msgstr "La página Machine"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This page sets up the running machine: **Model**, **Memory**, **ROM** and"
" the **Speed** slider at the top, then its devices in four groups - "
"**Storage**, **Input**, **Sound** and **Board**. The {icon}`settings` "
"gear beside a device opens the rest of its settings. See [The Machine "
"page](machines.md#the-machine-page)."
msgstr ""
"Esta página configura la máquina en marcha: **Model**, **Memory**, "
"**ROM** y el control deslizante **Speed** arriba, y después sus "
"dispositivos en cuatro grupos — **Storage**, **Input**, **Sound** y "
"**Board**. El engranaje {icon}`settings` junto a un dispositivo abre el "
"resto de sus ajustes. Consulta [La página Machine](machines.md#the-"
"machine-page)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What you change here is kept for this machine only. {icon}`save_all` "
"**Save machine...**, {icon}`refresh` **Restore machine** and "
"{icon}`cancel` **Delete this machine** are explained in [Your own "
"machines](machines.md#your-own-machines)."
msgstr ""
"Lo que cambias aquí se guarda solo para esta máquina. {icon}`save_all` "
"**Save machine...**, {icon}`refresh` **Restore machine** y {icon}`cancel`"
" **Delete this machine** se explican en [Tus propias "
"máquinas](machines.md#your-own-machines)."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "![The Video page](images/options-video.png)"
msgstr "![La página Video](images/options-video.png)"

msgid "The Video page"
msgstr "La página Video"

msgid ""
"**Picture** - border size, palette, shader, window size, fullscreen, gray"
" scale. See [Picture](picture.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Picture** — tamaño del borde, paleta, shader, tamaño de la ventana, "
"pantalla completa, escala de grises. Consulta [Imagen](picture.md)."

msgid "**Anti-flicker** - see [Anti-flicker](picture.md#anti-flicker)."
msgstr "**Anti-flicker** — consulta [Anti-flicker](picture.md#anti-flicker)."

msgid ""
"**Screenshots** - see [Screenshot settings](capture.md#screenshot-"
"settings)."
msgstr ""
"**Screenshots** — consulta [Ajustes de las capturas](capture.md"
"#screenshot-settings)."

msgid ""
"**Recording** - video recording through FFmpeg. See [Recording "
"settings](capture.md#recording-settings)."
msgstr ""
"**Recording** — grabación de vídeo mediante FFmpeg. Consulta [Ajustes de "
"grabación](capture.md#recording-settings)."

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Sound"

msgid "![The Sound page](images/options-sound.png)"
msgstr "![La página Sound](images/options-sound.png)"

msgid "The Sound page"
msgstr "La página Sound"

msgid ""
"**Output** (driver, rate, latency), the filters, and the volume of each "
"sound source. See [The Sound page](sound.md#the-sound-page). The sound "
"chips themselves are set on the **Machine** page."
msgstr ""
"**Output** (controlador, frecuencia, latencia), los filtros y el volumen "
"de cada fuente de sonido. Consulta [La página Sound](sound.md#the-sound-"
"page). Los chips de sonido en sí se configuran en la página **Machine**."

msgid "Input"
msgstr "Input"

msgid "![The Input page](images/options-input.png)"
msgstr "![La página Input](images/options-input.png)"

msgid "The Input page"
msgstr "La página Input"

msgid ""
"The keymap; the gamepads of **Player 1** and **Player 2**, with the "
"**Gamepads...** button that opens their window; and **Game bindings**. "
"See [Keyboard, joystick and mouse](input.md)."
msgstr ""
"El mapa de teclado; los mandos de **Player 1** y **Player 2**, con el "
"botón **Gamepads...** que abre su ventana; y **Game bindings**. Consulta "
"[Teclado, joystick y ratón](input.md)."

msgid "File types"
msgstr "File types"

msgid "![The File types page](images/options-filetypes.png)"
msgstr "![La página File types](images/options-filetypes.png)"

msgid "The File types page"
msgstr "La página File types"

msgid ""
"What opening a tape or a disk does - run it, mount it, or ask - and "
"whether the media in the drives come back at the next start. The table "
"says which machine each kind of file opens on. See [Which machine opens a"
" file](files.md#which-machine-opens-a-file)."
msgstr ""
"Qué hace abrir una cinta o un disco — ejecutarlo, montarlo o preguntar — "
"y si los soportes de las unidades vuelven en el siguiente arranque. La "
"tabla dice en qué máquina se abre cada tipo de archivo. Consulta [Qué "
"máquina abre un archivo](files.md#which-machine-opens-a-file)."

msgid "Emulation"
msgstr "Emulation"

msgid "![The Emulation page](images/options-emulation.png)"
msgstr "![La página Emulation](images/options-emulation.png)"

msgid "The Emulation page"
msgstr "La página Emulation"

msgid ""
"**Input lag** - **Low latency** and **Run ahead**. See [Input "
"lag](time.md#input-lag)."
msgstr ""
"**Input lag** — **Low latency** y **Run ahead**. Consulta [Retardo de "
"entrada](time.md#input-lag)."

msgid ""
"**Speed and rewind** - how far back rewind goes, how the keys of slow "
"motion, fast forward and fast mode work, and what fast mode shows. See "
"[Speed and time](time.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Speed and rewind** — hasta dónde llega el rebobinado, cómo funcionan "
"las teclas de cámara lenta, avance rápido y modo rápido, y qué muestra el"
" modo rápido. Consulta [Velocidad y tiempo](time.md)."

msgid "Debugger"
msgstr "Debugger"

msgid "![The Debugger page](images/options-debugger.png)"
msgstr "![La página Debugger](images/options-debugger.png)"

msgid "The Debugger page"
msgstr "La página Debugger"

msgid ""
"The font, the colors and what the Debugger shows. See [The Debugger page "
"of Options](debugger.md#the-debugger-page-of-options)."
msgstr ""
"La fuente, los colores y lo que muestra el Debugger. Consulta [La página "
"Debugger de Options](debugger.md#the-debugger-page-of-options)."

msgid "Hotkeys"
msgstr "Hotkeys"

msgid "![The Hotkeys page](images/options-hotkeys.png)"
msgstr "![La página Hotkeys](images/options-hotkeys.png)"

msgid "The Hotkeys page"
msgstr "La página Hotkeys"

msgid ""
"The keys of every command, in the Modern or Classic preset or one of your"
" own. See [Hotkeys](hotkeys.md)."
msgstr ""
"Las teclas de cada comando, en el preajuste Modern o Classic o en uno "
"tuyo. Consulta [Atajos de teclado](hotkeys.md)."

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Appearance"

msgid "![The Appearance page](images/options-appearance.png)"
msgstr "![La página Appearance](images/options-appearance.png)"

msgid "The Appearance page"
msgstr "La página Appearance"

msgid ""
"**Interface** - **Style**: **System** (the look of your system) or one of"
" seven bundled styles."
msgstr ""
"**Interface** — **Style**: **System** (el aspecto de tu sistema) o uno de"
" los siete estilos incluidos."

msgid ""
"**Indicators** - which signs are shown over the picture. See [Indicators "
"on the picture](picture.md#indicators-on-the-picture)."
msgstr ""
"**Indicators** — qué indicadores se muestran sobre la imagen. Consulta "
"[Indicadores sobre la imagen](picture.md#indicators-on-the-picture)."

msgid "Application"
msgstr "Application"

msgid "![The Application page](images/options-application.png)"
msgstr "![La página Application](images/options-application.png)"

msgid "The Application page"
msgstr "La página Application"

msgid ""
"**Machine at start** - see [Machine at start](machines.md#machine-at-"
"start)."
msgstr ""
"**Machine at start** — consulta [Machine at start](machines.md#machine-"
"at-start)."

msgid ""
"**Listen port** - the network port the program listens on, for tools that"
" control it."
msgstr ""
"**Listen port** — el puerto de red en el que escucha el programa, para "
"herramientas que lo controlan."

msgid "**Confirm exit** - ask before closing."
msgstr "**Confirm exit** — preguntar antes de cerrar."

msgid ""
"**Pause when inactive** - pause the machine while the window is in the "
"background. See [Pause](time.md#pause)."
msgstr ""
"**Pause when inactive** — pausar la máquina mientras la ventana está en "
"segundo plano. Consulta [Pausa](time.md#pause)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`star` **Manage favorites...** - see "
"[Favorites](files.md#favorites)."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`star` **Manage favorites...** — consulta "
"[Favorites](files.md#favorites)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`save_all` **Export settings...**, {icon}`fileopen` **Import "
"settings...** - keep all your settings, your own machines included, in "
"one file, and bring them back."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`save_all` **Export settings...**, {icon}`fileopen` **Import "
"settings...** — guarda todos tus ajustes, incluidas tus propias máquinas,"
" en un archivo, y recupéralos."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{icon}`refresh` **Reset to defaults** - puts every setting back to its "
"default value. Your own machines stay."
msgstr ""
"{icon}`refresh` **Reset to defaults** — devuelve cada ajuste a su valor "
"por defecto. Tus propias máquinas se conservan."

msgid ""
"**Log** - a log file of what the program does, for reporting a problem: "
"**Write a log file**, **To the console**, **Level**, **Folder**."
msgstr ""
"**Log** — un archivo de registro de lo que hace el programa, para "
"informar de un problema: **Write a log file**, **To the console**, "
"**Level**, **Folder**."

